Z||000017||Raydar||08-27-2001||02:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84Bill:<BR><B>BTW<P>PA has enacted a new law 2 months ago whereby you can be fined for driving in the left lane if the right lane is clear for you to move over.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>About time they did that in GA, too. But I'm not holding my breath.<P><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
